  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "Hospital-Strength Suction | Momcozy V series Breast Pump | Motor Goes in Your Pocket | Trusted by 6 Million+ Moms | See Your Milk as It Flows | 9 Sessions Per Charge | Closed Anti-Backflow System | Free 1-on-1 IBCLC Session | Quiet 48 dB Operation | Up to -300 mmHg Suction | Hospital Grade Wearable Pump | Save 20% with Code BDBW20 | 17-24mm Inserts Included | Hospital-grade | Up to -300 mmHg suction with 15 levels and 3 modes. Motor slips into your pocket | Leak-resistant DoubleFit flange and a clear 7.8 oz collector. Only 120g per cup | Up to 9 sessions per charge at a quiet 48 dB. Includes 17, 19, 21 and 24mm sizing | Save 20% sitewide with code BDBW20, Aug 1-7. FSA/HSA eligible, free shipping",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObBgjg/Primary Text",
   "heading_path": "Primary Text",
   "meta": {
    "kind": "field_value",
    "field_name": "Primary Text"
   },
   "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdObBgjg",
   "kb_type": "wording",
   "source_sha256": "1ca01a6690922a697e9d428439674863df67709688a6b32fe846705603f5e011",
   "order_in_parent": 2,
   "parent_unit_id": null,
   "unit_id": "4114bf7d4514c3b8c1d6",
   "char_count": 704,
   "pair_ref": null
  },
  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "效果百分比/销量/评分声称需附测试来源与口径，否则删除（折扣百分比不在此列） ▸ hospital/medical grade 需认证依据，否则删除 ▸ 奶流/移除量/排空效率/漏奶/短时排乳类claim需W1自身对照数据（样本、对照、统计口径齐全），或改为放松叙事+限定语（may help/natural）；内部测试数值（28.2%/10%/70%）补齐前不得公开传播 ▸ 核验 IBCLC/专家身份、参与方式、程序设计依据与 COI 披露后再保留（含 expert-tuned/专家调校/专家程序） ▸ hospital/NICU 场景表述需事实依据，否则删除",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObBgjg/修改建议",
   "heading_path": "修改建议",
   "meta": {
    "kind": "field_value",
